      "writtenOn": "2026-11-24T19:56:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "[warning] 🟡 `validateChannelHistory` can return `PENDING_DEPENDENCY` with `missingPolicies \u003d {circle.head}` when `HistoryValidator::run()` fails without `invalid` set, even if the actual unresolved dependencies are different policy commits. This makes diagnostics/retry behavior inaccurate. Build `missingPolicies` from the unresolved `policies` map (and root authorization if still pending) in this path as well, so callers get the real missing commits.",
      "revId": "625ddb9b252f0b3d629edb5d4c50f2914c21e163",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
